        {
            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "This is expected because 'mini.surround' uses the same keys to add surrounding in both Normal and Visual modes. This requirement was one of the main reasons to use prefix-style default keys (`sa`, `sd`, etc.) instead of suffix-style (`ys`, `ds`, etc.).\r\n\r\nThere is a [documented suggested config](https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/49e2699dc0d585b445eda24ed4bb45952ac20508/doc/mini-surround.txt#L533) to achieve functionality similar to 'tpope/vim-surround'. In particular, it requires [tweaking some mappings manually](https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/49e2699dc0d585b445eda24ed4bb45952ac20508/doc/mini-surround.txt#L555-L560).",
